**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.nuxt/
**/.next/
**/.output/
**/.fougere/
# wrangler's local state — a workerd sandbox and its D1 files, rebuilt on every `dev`
**/.wrangler/
# Claude Code's working directory. It named only the settings file, so a `worktrees/`
# holding a whole checkout each came through — none of it describes this repository.
.claude/
**/*.generated.ts
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.data/
CLAUDE.local.md
.fougere/
.revue.md
.vscode/
.revue.json

# Reading paths — regenerated by `/plan-revue`, and written in whatever language it was asked in.
**/REVIEW.md

# Playwright's run artifacts — the report is regenerated by `pnpm e2e`.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# pnpm content-addressable store, if one lands in the tree
.pnpm-store/
benchmarks/
benchmark/

# `scripts/*.py` bytecode
**/__pycache__/
# demos/ projected into the site at build — site/apps/web/modules/demo.ts
site/apps/web/content/demo/
site/apps/web/content/tutorial/
# written by site/apps/web/modules/reference.ts; 01.cli and 02.errors are written by hand
site/apps/web/content/reference/0[3-9].*.md
site/apps/web/content/reference/1[0-9].*.md
site/apps/web/content/reference/packages/
site/apps/web/public/demo/

# Rendered by `foundryctl cast` when a demo brings a collector up — local state.
demos/*/signoz/casting.yaml.lock
demos/*/signoz/pours/

# What `pnpm clip` films — regenerated from the starter on every run.
tools/clip/out/
.DS_Store
